# Private planning notes and internal documentation. Never committed.
#
# No trailing slash, deliberately. A Conductor worktree does not get gitignored directories, so a
# session working in one symlinks `docs` and `tasks` back to the main checkout to make the paths in
# CLAUDE.md resolve — and `docs/` matches a directory, not a symlink to one. With the slash, `git
# status` listed both symlinks as untracked and a `git add -A` would have committed them.
docs
tasks

node_modules/
.next/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
.env.local
next-env.d.ts

# The embedding model. Fetched with `pnpm fetch-model`, never committed — see ops/fetch-model.sh.
.models/
